{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/honq9q0so6",
  "title": "一个找工具导航站的方法，用于提交自己的网站",
  "author": "阿威",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">很多小伙伴做完了自己的工具站，都有找工具导航站来提交自己网站的需求，我这里分享一个方法给大家</h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">我是阿威，我在六群，希望能跟大家多多交流</h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">开门见山，就一句Google搜索语法</h2>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">inurl</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"submit\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">intext</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"submit\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AND</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"tool\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">intitle</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"submit\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AND</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"tool\"</span></code></div></pre>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div>如果需要明确跟AI相关，还可以加上个关键词“AI”</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">inurl</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"submit\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">intext</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"submit\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AND</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"tool\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">intitle</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"submit\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AND</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"tool\"</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">AND</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"AI\"</span></code></div></pre>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">可以看到搜索结果，还是蛮精准的，有两万多条结果\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_img1.png\" alt=\"微信截图_20250320150835.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div>那么怎么判断它们活不活跃呢，我一般拿它们的域名去用site语法搜索一下，近一个月是否有收录，如果一条都没有，那么我认为它不活跃，当然这个判断标准很主观，大家可以自行判断</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">site</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>aitoolsdirectory</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_img2.png\" alt=\"微信截图_20250320151502.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">还有个问题，就是Google并不会让我们完完全全看到这几万多条结果，一般到了十几二十页，后面就不给显示了，结果数也变成两百多\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_img3.png\" alt=\"微信截图_20250320151738.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">那么怎么办呢，我的做法就是分时间段来查找，比如一个月一个月去查，这样结果数不会很多，基本上能让我们看完\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_img4.png\" alt=\"微信截图_20250320152020.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">找到出现了这种长链接，长标题的时候，基本上后面就没有了\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_img5.png\" alt=\"微信截图_20250320152225.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n继续把时间往前设置一个月，继续找，就能收集到很多可以工具导航站了，里面有些收费，有些免费，可以先把免费可以提交的给提交了，过段时间看看哪些收录了，再进一步筛选出可收录的，以后发这些就好了</h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">在找的时候发现，为什么没有出现There An AI For That，<a href=\"https://theresanaiforthat.com/submit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://theresanaiforthat.com/submit/</a>跟杉木大哥的Toolify，<a href=\"https://www.toolify.ai/zh/submit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.toolify.ai/zh/submit</a>这两大导航站呢，去分析了一下，原来，他们这个提交页面的metadata似乎没有单独设置，所以就没有在搜索结果之中了\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/honq9q0so6_img6.png\" alt=\"微信截图_20250320153046.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\"><strong>咱们还有很多找外链相关的帖子，列举几个我看过的，很有收获</strong></h2>\n<div><a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/01qvdowwfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/01qvdowwfm</a>\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/zfv8i83wmk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/topic/zfv8i83wmk</a>\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/5qfl13vv2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/topic/5qfl13vv2e</a></div>",
